/T (Indian agencies run client approvals on WhatsApp. Drifty is a Nexconn-powered chat room where clients talk naturally \(even Hinglish voice notes\); AI turns it into a change list, catches conflicting feedback and missed changes, and records a dispute-proof approval.)
